    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy an immersive story of science fiction, in which artificial intelligence makes the case for itself as an artist and collaborator.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome! Please accept this invitation to our virtual gallery experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No Artist Credited</strong></i> is an experiment in the capabilities and limitations of AI tools. The entire gallery was designed and constructed using instructions, themes, and art generated by one of three AI. <strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means that,<strong> </strong>yes,<strong> disclaimer: this game was made using AI tools. </strong>Since it is impossible to credit all the artists involved, there is no entry fee and you may come and go as you please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I developed the game as a walking simulator to invite guests to peruse the digital art in its natural habitat (digitally) as one might visit an art museum.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We hope you enjoy your visit.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Curator</p>",
